  "Durrett's Remark after Theorem 2.1.7 (p. 47) is not in the chapter itself; it is supplied on the route at conditioning-independence-and-information-w02b-p15-006.tex lines 186-196 with thm:p15-w02c-p15-006-lambda-class.",
  "The p. 53 locator was read as the finite-construction paragraph that the chapter pairs it with (lines 15-17); the Kolmogorov-extension material and the Andersen-Jessen remark on the same page belong to the countable-product presentation that def:p15-independence-next points to. That boundary's sentence that the extension's measurable-space hypotheses 'remain essential' has no supporting counterexample on the current route."
